  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<p>Unstoppable is an adrenaline-pumping horror adventure where you’re tasked with escaping Schindler Tower.</p>\n<p>A mysterious gas has turned office workers insane … Now everyone is out for blood. Face dimly-lit corridors filled with death, search for clues to find a cure, and keep the psychotic horde at bay any way you can. Will you get to the bottom of the infection or die in the dark?</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Realistic Combat:</b> Challenging, physics-based combat. Feel the weight of each blow and dodge infected enemies.\n</li><li><b>Unpredictable Enemies:</b> The infected do not all think alike – watch out for new weapons and attack patterns.\n</li><li><b>Finite Resources:</b> Your weapons are limited – use them well. Balance item durability against increasingly difficult enemies.\n</li><li><b>Shadowed World:</b> Play a game of cat and mouse in the shadows. Stay cautious – the infected can hear your footsteps!\n</li><li><b>Episodic Story:</b> What is this mysterious gas, and who unleashed it? Unravel the global conspiracy with each new chapter.\n</li><li><b>Berserk Mode:</b> Strive to keep your humanity as the infection builds in your system. Stay sharp or join the infected.\n</li></ul>\n",
